          ],
          "value": "Involved in the biosynthesis of glucosylglycerate. Catalyzes the dephosphorylation of glucosyl-3-phosphoglycerate (GPG) and mannosyl-3-phosphoglycerate (MPG) to glucosylglycerate (GG) and mannosylglycerate (MG), respectively"
